        // Added by Vyankat B. on 22-Jun-2026 - Centralised page-level access control
        // Hides/shows buttons based on AddAccess, EditAccess and DeleteAccess flags:
        //   EditAccess   = false → hide Add Resource btn, Edit btn in resource rows,
        //                          Task Attribute Select buttons, Document Upload button
